    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010\u26a0Warning\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u203bNote that this game is suitable for players who like gore and Ryona.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u203bThis game contains a lot of extremely bloody and violent content.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The heroine will experience death repeatedly, and the death scenes will be directly shown through illustrations.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Story\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264480/extras/b2da65dca39aa780d9aa4d4cf9130666.avif?t=1752883110\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A few years after Colt entered the forest, the originally weak Philum also became an adventurer after recovering.<br>In a tavern where she stayed, Philum heard that Colt's last direction was &quot;Slave's Forest.&quot;<br>In order to track down her sister's whereabouts, she also headed towards the forest\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what greets her in front will be her sister whom she has not seen for many years, or perhaps more...<strong>desperation</strong>\u2026?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Features\u3011</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardcore Ryona\u30fbgory  visual novel game Various death scenarios</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264480/extras/b70de330a30005c09875aeb8ff1b63c3.avif?t=1752883110\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 After being bitten off her hands and feet by a crocodile-type devouring beast, the area above the shoulders was also bitten off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264480/extras/882b0dbc5ef6e3cd6a983f819f574329.avif?t=1752883110\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 Pierced by sharp rocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 Petrified and then shattered by a stone press.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heroine has full Japanese dubbing.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Character\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264480/extras/0407530196ba51d40a8aeaf22f7b214c.avif?t=1752883110\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Philum Eles Shaksty(CV. \u6885\u539f\u4e9c\u8863)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gentle elf magician.</p>",
